    {
      "text": "Take upon you the name of Christ, D&C 18:21. all men must take upon them the name, D&C 18:24. hear me not will I curse, that have professed my name, D&C 41:1 (112:26). abominations in the church that profess my name, D&C 50:4. men beware how they take my name in their lips, D&C 63:61. thy name may be upon them, D&C 109:22. faithful before me unto my name, D&C 112:12. I will magnify my name, D&C 132:64.",
